Summary
=======

Problem:
Unauthorized switches can join the network and manipulate STP, trunks, and VLANs.

Solution:
Combine BPDU Guard, Port Security, DTP Disable, and Access Port Hardening.

Benefit:
Prevents rogue switches from participating in the network.

Limitation:
Does not detect one-way physical link failures.

Next Practical:
UDLD (Unidirectional Link Detection)
